C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eEJhJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"afc53ef3-1bbf-4e08-817f-10cdb827e857","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、自分は割と適当に買っちゃったってのがあるのでちゃんと調べてBelkinの方がよかったとかは思っちゃってます\n買い直せるなら自分もそうしそうです","ts":"1632373722.454600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U027UKB8YTW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kj+Uu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d092a5c1-feb1-41c1-87d5-7f6f8ebb7a34","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"ycino氏にオススメ頂いたドッキングステーションも物凄く調べたのですが、\nこのbelkinはクラムシェルもamphetimine + displayplayのアプリの組み合わせで実現しつつ複数モニタへの出力ができたりと、いつかそうしたい時にできるという安心さもあってコレにしました\n最大85Wの電源出力もできるのでMacbook Pro 16inchまでならこれ１本で代用できますし、いまのところとても満足してます！","ts":"1632373657.453700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Xk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3155916-af51-43ba-9d3f-81ee50f1ed8b","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"凄い、デスクから出来るオーラが迸ってる","ts":"1632373597.452400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O8QZY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"378ddb1b-0082-407c-a6c5-2384f289e880","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"かっちょいいー","ts":"1632373470.450800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F/2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65f941a3-aa02-4de5-8ccc-290d480f1ca4","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"自分は充電ケーブルやHHKBでどうしても結構な数ケーブルが伸びちゃっている","ts":"1632373378.450600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nQf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3786de7c-0d28-4c0e-b38c-ccaa346bc1b8","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"いい話","ts":"1632373358.450100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lisT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf246719-04b5-40d6-9f9a-95418868ed03","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"色々あってデスク周りがやっと完成しました。\nここに至るまでセイルチェアとかHHKBとか色々買って全然合わなくて売ったりと犠牲沢山あったのですが、現状250%満足してます。\n\n特に短足なのでオカムラシルフィが完全に体型マッチして史上最高に感動しました（アトラスシリーズも良さそうだけど一旦これはあぐらもしやすいのでこっちにした）\nあとbelkinのドッキングステーションでACもUSBもHDMIも全て１元化できてよかったです、Mac対応で色々できるドッキングステーションがあまり他になかった・・・\n43inchのモニターだけは専用ケーブル使わないと4K60Hzでないので、妥協してケーブルは２本になってます\n\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/ulwlu1/status/1440899917954703360?s=20\u003e","ts":"1632373198.448600","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/ulwlu1|@ulwlu1\u003e: 色々あって、、、かんせぃ！\n\nメインモニター: 43inch 4K\n椅子: オカムラ シルフィ\n机: バウヒュッテ 昇降\nドッキング: Belkin\nキーボード: Magic Keyboard\n\n特に椅子が唯一無二。オカムラの40cmまで下がる超低座面\u0026amp;75cmまで上がるアームレストが最高に日本人体系の自分が探してた椅子でしたにゃ(ΦωΦ) \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E_8a00IVgBInb-5.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"ulwlu ☆°｡⋆⸜(* '꒳' *)⸝","author_subname":"@ulwlu1","author_link":"https://twitter.com/ulwlu1/status/1440899917954703360","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1437311452713422848/zT36TjsR_normal.jpg","text":"色々あって、、、かんせぃ！\n\nメインモニター: 43inch 4K\n椅子: オカムラ シルフィ\n机: バウヒュッテ 昇降\nドッキング: Belkin\nキーボード: Magic Keyboard\n\n特に椅子が唯一無二。オカムラの40cmまで下がる超低座面\u0026amp;75cmまで上がるアームレストが最高に日本人体系の自分が探してた椅子でしたにゃ(ΦωΦ) \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E_8a00IVgBInb-5.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/E_8a00IVgBInb-5.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1632372285,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/ulwlu1/status/1440899917954703360?s=20","original_url":"https://twitter.com/ulwlu1/status/1440899917954703360?s=20"}],"files":[{"id":"F02EXUWRNP9","created":1632373082,"timestamp":1632373082,"name":"a.jpg","title":"a.jpg","mimetype":"image/jpeg","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"jpg","pretty_type":"JPEG","user":"U027UKB8YTW","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size"